                        "description": "Once a valid payment agreement has approved by the payer this endpoint is used to create a payment initiation, which creates real time pull payments.\nYou are allowed a maximum of 5 failed initiations in a 24 hour period, if you reach this limit you will need to wait until the next day to retry."
